questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput caching service experiences a severe memory leak, eventually throwing `java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space`. The code snippet below shows the custom cache implementation:

java
public class SessionCache<K, V> {
    private final Map<K, CacheEntry<K, V>> map = Collections.synchronizedMap(new WeakHashMap<>());

    public void put(K key, V value) {
        map.put(key, new CacheEntry<>(key, value));
    }

    private static class CacheEntry<K, V> {
        private final K key;
        private final V value;

        public CacheEntry(K key, V value) {
            this.key = key;
            this.value = value;
        }
    }
}
